            contentEn = "• CUET-UG Agriculture Entry: Conducted by NTA. Domain papers award +5 marks for each correct answer and deduct -1 mark for each wrong answer.\n\n• ICAR AIEEA (UG) Admissions: Admissions to premier Agricultural Universities (IARI, NDRI, GBPUAT, PAU, BHU) utilize CUET (ICAR-UG) scores across subject streams like ABC (Agriculture-Biology-Chemistry), PCB, or PCM.\n\n• Smart Preparation Plan:\n  1. Master NCERT Class 11 & 12 Biology and Chemistry line by line.\n  2. Build quick-revision tables for crop botanical names, varieties, soil orders, and livestock breeds.\n  3. Attempt 2 timed mock tests weekly to reduce negative marking errors.",
